<title>RUSSIA: Russian Oct PPI at 2.8 pct, y/y down to 29.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian Oct PPI at 2.8 pct, y/y down to 29.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian monthly industrial prices rose 2.8 percent in October, but year-on-year PPI inflation fell to 29.5 percent from 31.4 percent in September, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES  OCT 96    SEP 96    OCT 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +2.8	+1.8	+4.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +29.5     +31.4    +230.0</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
